  "goodToKnow": "Die Drohne is a drone, the unmanned aircraft: eine Drohne fliegen. Originally, Drohnen are male honeybees, which don't work or gather honey, so figuratively a Drohne was also a lazy person. In Germany, flying most drones requires registration and, above 250 grams, a drone licence, the EU-Kompetenznachweis, and there are no-fly zones around airports and over crowds. Plural: die Drohnen."
